A. EXACT FACTS (enumeration over the C(8,4) = 70 relabelings)
  attainable p <= 0.05: 1/70 = 0.0143, 2/70 = 0.0286, 3/70 = 0.0429; 4/70 = 0.0571 is not
  size under exchangeable continuous values: P(p <= 0.05) = 3/70 = 0.0429 (the observed split's rank among the 70 sums is uniform)
  fill: one control missing: the smallest filled p over 400 completely separated sets = 18/35 = 0.5143
  fill: one blind missing: the smallest filled p over 400 completely separated sets = 18/35 = 0.5143
  fill: one missing in each arm: the smallest filled p over 400 completely separated sets = 51/70 = 0.7286
  fill: two control missing: the smallest filled p over 400 completely separated sets = 4/5 = 0.8000
  (so one MISSING continuation, in either arm, makes REDUCED unreadable, as in BS)

